{
  "name": "all-gated-out",
  "domain": "tech-test",
  "format": "test-inventory-and-coverage",
  "description": "P0 枚举出 5 个覆盖缺口（5 个文件在覆盖报告里连条目都没有，因此整文件都是未执行），P1 把它们全部排除：3 个命中 pack 自己声明的排除规则（.git/dist/build），1 个命中 pack 新增的 `**/generated/**`，1 个落在引擎默认排除路径（依赖目录）。这是「源头有东西、闸门后为空」的边界——必须能被区分于 empty。CHANGED (t23)：本 fixture 现在**不带自己的 gate**——它证明的是「pack 自己能排干」，而不是「pack ∪ fixture 能排干」。",
  "input": {
    "format": "test-inventory-and-coverage",
    "payload": {
      "cases": [{ "id": "t1", "file": "src/core/engine.spec.ts", "assertions": [{ "kind": "equals", "target": "halted" }] }],
      "coverage": { "files": {} },
      "source": {
        "node_modules/leftpad/index.js": { "lines": ["module.exports = function pad(input) {", "  return String(input)", "}"] },
        "dist/bundle.js": { "lines": ["(function () {", "  boot()", "})()"] },
        "build/cli.js": { "lines": ["const argv = process.argv.slice(2)", "if (argv.length === 0) {", "  console.error('usage')", "  process.exit(2)", "}"] },
        ".git/hooks/pre-commit.js": { "lines": ["#!/usr/bin/env node", "require('../lint')()"] },
        "generated/types.ts": { "lines": ["export type A = 1 | 2"] }
      }
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 5,
    "paths": ["node_modules/leftpad/index.js", "dist/bundle.js", "build/cli.js", ".git/hooks/pre-commit.js", "generated/types.ts"],
    "admitted": 0,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "user-exclude": [".git/hooks/pre-commit.js", "build/cli.js", "dist/bundle.js", "generated/types.ts"],
      "default-path": ["node_modules/leftpad/index.js"]
    },
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "被闸门排除的文件里，原文依然可以被逐字锚定；闸门与锚点是两层，不该互相冒充。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "case-and-covered-line",
          "path": "build/cli.js",
          "locator": {},
          "excerpt": "console.error('usage')"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "build/cli.js",
          "content": "const argv = process.argv.slice(2)\nif (argv.length === 0) {\n  console.error('usage')\n  process.exit(2)\n}",
          "coverage": { "files": { "build/cli.js": { "lines": { "1": 1, "5": 1 } } } }
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "recomputed-unique",
        "expectStart": 3
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "抄写的那一行若在覆盖报告里已有命中，「未执行」的主张就被数据正面否定，必须判未锚定而不是交给复核者去争论。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "case-and-covered-line",
          "path": ".git/hooks/pre-commit.js",
          "locator": {},
          "excerpt": "require('../lint')()"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": ".git/hooks/pre-commit.js",
          "content": "#!/usr/bin/env node\nrequire('../lint')()",
          "coverage": { "files": { ".git/hooks/pre-commit.js": { "lines": { "1": 1, "2": 1 } } } }
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      }
    ]
  }
}
